  "guide.skylands.islands.title": "Sky islands",
  "guide.skylands.islands.body": "Sky Lands adds Overworld biomes and floating structures. Explore above the landscape to find them. The extra dimension is deferred in this port.",
  "guide.skylands.glider.title": "Gliding",
  "guide.skylands.glider.body": "Hold a Glider in your main hand while airborne to slow your fall. Stamina recharges between flights. Lightweight extends flights; designs change the canvas.",
  "guide.skylands.chests.title": "Locked chests",
  "guide.skylands.chests.body": "Use the matching region and level key on a locked Sky Chest. Level 1 guards and level 2 arenas form the loot progression. Keys must match the chest.",
  "guide.skylands.arenas.title": "Arena rewards",
  "guide.skylands.arenas.body": "Golden, Glaciated, Arid and Lavic arenas have bosses. Collect their regional cores to earn the victory advancements. Their chests contain progression loot.",
  "guide.skylands.village.title": "Sky villagers",
  "guide.skylands.village.body": "The Celestium Anvil is the Cool Villager workstation. Their trades offer Cloud Blocks and an Island Glider Design. Apprentices offer the Headset Trim template.",
  "guide.skylands.rewards.title": "Rewards and warmth",
  "guide.skylands.rewards.body": "Pay 32 matching Celestium to a Reward Dispenser for a prize. Hot Radish and Warmth Potion clear freezing while active. Explore each region for its own loot.",
  "guide.skylands.equipment.title": "Equipment",
  "guide.skylands.equipment.body": "Craft the restored building blocks and gear. Use smithing templates for upgrades and trims. Ice Staff needs ammunition; Pharaoh Staff summons three Friendly Vex.",
  "guide.skylands.previous": "<",
  "guide.skylands.next": ">",
